# Harvesting architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/harvesting.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/harvesting.md).

**Permanent decision:** one material pipeline, two extractors (**on-foot** tools
vs nodes; **ship** mining hardpoints vs asteroids/debris). **Cell** owns HP,
deplete, yield grant, craft deduct. Yields via [Loot tables](../../docs/docs/architecture/loot-tables.md);
**never AC**. Recipes spend tagged materials at authored stations. Mining ≠
combat weapons. Survival kits and flight sustain share the craft graph.
[Player](../../docs/docs/architecture/player.md),
[Missions](../../docs/docs/architecture/missions.md),
[Multiplayer](../../docs/docs/architecture/multiplayer.md),
[Content delivery](../../docs/docs/architecture/content-delivery.md).

When changing harvest nodes, ship mining, yield grants, craft stations/recipes,
or gather mission credit, read the full doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
